GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Uga-Buga Makumb (#1):
  In fall, Teleko (#72) flew over to the Daedalus Sea.
  An army coming from the empire of Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1) 
entered the Daedalus Sea, hoping to conquer that province owned by 
Lady of Beer Mbaba (#3) and made up of great Plains.  Teleko (#72)'s forces 
encountered little resistance in the Daedalus Sea and Teleko there 
established our rule.
  In early winter, Teleko rode his flying armies over to Berga.
  A conquering horde owing their allegiance to 
Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1) invaded the province of Berga, a 
Desert area ruled by Lady of Beer Mbaba (#3).  Teleko (#72)'s forces 
encountered little resistance in Berga and Teleko there established our 
rule.


